| `article-has-problem` | primary study | many-to-many | problem-code (P1–P6) | {P1, P2, P3, P4, P5, P6} | 文章可无 problem 报告；Table V 只列有关联的文章 | Table V: "Problem Themes and Related Articles" | 描述哪些文章报告哪些 problem |
